@startuml
!include 00-style.puml
skinparam linetype polyline

object "用户端页面" as UI
object "Gateway" as GW
object "AgentController" as AC
object "AgentOrchestrator" as AO
object "RagKnowledgeService" as RAG
object "ToolRegistry" as TR
object "AiEdgeClient" as AEC
object "数据库" as DB

UI -> GW : 1: 发送问答请求
GW -> AC : 2: 转发并附带身份
AC -> AO : 3: chat/streamChat
AO -> DB : 4: 读取/保存会话消息
AO -> RAG : 5: 检索知识上下文
RAG -> AO : 6: 返回证据片段
AO -> TR : 7: 按意图定位工具
TR -> AO : 8: 返回工具实例
AO -> AEC : 9: 触发模型生成
AEC -> AO : 10: 返回回答内容
AO -> DB : 11: 保存回答与审计
AO -> AC : 12: 返回结构化结果
AC -> GW : 13: 输出响应
GW -> UI : 14: 展示可追溯答案

@enduml
